This is a VR rendition of the REND386 Circuit for the Sega 3D glasses.
It was modeled after the artwork in PCVR.  I did not use this setup for
my circuit so it may be off.  This is for visualization purposes and does
not boast to be electronically correct (So don't use it on a sole basis to
build your board)

The Board is set up in a figure file and the board is the pivot point.  So
highlight the board and everything will rotate around it.

For more info read the sega3d.wld file comments.

